Package: com.nucleartweaks.version-nuke
Name: VersionNuke
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 15.0)
Maintainer: Spec
Author: Spec
Description: Pin App Store apps to a known-good version. Per-app version pin: updates stop being offered, auto-update is neutered for that app, and any manual update reinstalls the pinned build instead of the new one. Unpin anytime.
Section: Tweaks
